  "prefLabel": "Arch 401.01 Expirations and Renewals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 401.01 Expirations and Renewals. Pursuant to RSA 310:8, licenses shall be renewed by written application prior to the expiration date and by payment of the prescribed renewal fee. The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) shall notify each architect at least 2 months prior to expiration of their license.\n\nSource. #3029, eff 5-28-85; ss by #4599, eff 4-13-89, EXPIRED: 4-13-95\n\nNew. #6153, eff 12-27-95; ss by #6409, eff 12-25-96; ss by #7944, eff 8-27-03; ss by #9097, eff 2-29-08; ss by #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #14492, eff 3-24-26, EXPIRES: 3-24-36",
